            "notes": "The best power to get first is [Cross-Orbal](item_e567bb63-527f-4c72-8ba1-dc59be1a0dc1) - this lets you do damage while healing yourself and others. With both healing and damage orbs increased (via ability power), it's easy to get the money needed to buy upgrades and snowball in later rounds.\n\n\nItems:\n- [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) gives a small boost to Ability Power.\n- [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) kicks in after your ult giving bonus Ability Power and Shields.\n- [Shady Spectacles](item_ef9bb72f-a56c-4fb6-a552-5abce0b943d7) increases survivability but could be swapped out for another survivability item like [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6).",
