            "notes": "Power:\n- [Multiball](item_5d0e4135-f4e1-42fb-991a-417643064560) is the best power for this build. I rarely go for it on Round 1 because you need a lot of Ability Power to make the best use out of it.\n\nItems:\n- [Extendrils](item_138e73a2-6915-4ffc-bd89-029a85bf94b8) is another great item and essential for this build. It will help keep orbs in the vicinity of players for longer, increasing their efficacy.\n\nBuy anything else that you can afford to increase Ability Power.\nI like [Energized Bracers](item_f83a1d9e-91f8-4d2c-bd62-c673b8d9fd2e) or [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) if I have spare cash.",
